config BR2_PACKAGE_RPI_UTILS
	bool "rpi-utils (vcgencmd)"
	depends on BR2_arm || BR2_aarch64
	help
	  vcgencmd from Raspberry Pi's utils repository: queries the
	  VideoCore firmware through /dev/vcio (bootloader version,
	  clocks, temperatures, throttling).

	  Buildroot 2026.08 removed rpi-userland, which used to provide
	  vcgencmd. Only the vcgencmd tool is built from this repository.

	  https://github.com/raspberrypi/utils
